[size=4][b]Description[/b][/size]
Quality-of-life additions for Moon Sweepers as one BepInEx plugin. Everything is sold as an upgrade in the game's own upgrade tree, so it is earned, not handed out. More features will follow.

[size=4][b]Main features[/b][/size]
[b]Landmark Scanner[/b] is a new node in the Suit branch of the upgrade tree (needs Servo Stride). Once bought it marks the landmark flags and lunar sites you have not raised yet:
[list]
[*]On the compass, in the game's own style and with distance. The nearest one always shows, pinned to the edge when it is behind you.
[*]On the station hologram and on the map screen opened from it, with the game's own hover panel and click handling.
[/list]
Raised landmarks are left to the game, which already draws them.

[size=4][b]Installation instructions[/b][/size]
[list=1]
[*]Install BepInEx for the game with the MoonSweepers BepInEx Patcher (see Requirements).
[*]Extract the zip over the Moon Sweepers game folder, so MoonSweepersQol.dll ends up in BepInEx/plugins.
[*]Launch the game, open the upgrade terminal and buy the Landmark Scanner in the Suit branch.
[/list]
Set RequireUpgrade to false in BepInEx/config/dodo.moonsweepers.qol.cfg to have everything on without buying it.

[size=4][b]Requirements[/b][/size]
BepInEx 6 for this game, installed with [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/moonsweepers/mods/9]MoonSweepers BepInEx Patcher[/url].

